{"id":"vod_sn_37128","vodId":"37128","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"终物语","name_cn":"终物语","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/a2b9bc5979791e280b51c318bff2646d.jpg"},"summary":"《终物语》讲述改编自日本轻小说家西尾维新著作、台湾插画家VOFAN负责插画的轻小说，是《物语系列》终季（Final Season）的第3部，分为上中下三册。《终物语》是物语系列小说第三部分的第二弹作品。其内容包括第完话：扇黑暗（おうぎダーク），讲述了与一种被阿良良木历称为暗黑暗之影（くらやみ）的怪异有关的故事。 实际上暗根本没有名字。不是怪异，甚至是根本不存在的非存在。卧烟伊豆湖称之为怪异的反存在，世界、命运的修正力本身，追杀偏离了怪异之道的怪异的非存在。看上去是一团漆黑黑洞般，让人联想到黑洞。可将接触到东西的存在完全消失，甚至可以切断历与忍野忍的链。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:49:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9ZJSHXfeSD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ySGqv7S56P1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/efK01uUQzw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mg6YfQbbmT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TF5AvupZP61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZcmhwaaPsB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/t7gVmKpHP01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sd2qwEg4Rr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RPnQK6s1wP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2FJSri80k41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UdzfYCwued1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uLSJxwJ23s1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:14.485Z"}